   <section class="connections-belief" id="connections-belief">
    <div class="connections-belief__image connections-belief__image--left"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/connections3.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="connections-belief__image connections-belief__image--top"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/connections2.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="connections-belief__image connections-belief__image--bottom"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/connections4.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="connections-belief__content">
     <div class="connections-belief__label">
      OUR BELIEF
     </div>
     <div class="connections-belief__title head-area">
      <div class="overflow">
       <div class="en">
        FR<span>O</span>M GENUINE CONNECTIONS
       </div>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow">
       <div class="en">
        T<span>O</span> STRONGER COMMUNITIES
       </div>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="connections-belief__desc">
      <p>A cup of tea can start a conversation.</p>
      <p>A simple act of kindness can bring a community together.</p>
      <p>At KOI, we cherish every encounter and believe that even<br>
        the smallest actions can create a lasting impact. Through <br>
       our ongoing commitment to community engagement and<br>
        social initiatives, we extend warmth beyond the cup and<br>
        into the lives of those around us.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
