        <p>Collaborating with organizations and community partners to create positive and lasting impact together.</p>
       </div>
       <div class="connections-feature__meta"> <strong>01</strong>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="connections-feature__panel " data-index="1">
       <h2>COMMUNITY<br>
         ENGAGEMENT</h2>
       <div class="connections-feature__desc">
        <p>Actively engaging with local communities and fostering meaningful connections with the people we serve.</p>
       </div>
       <div class="connections-feature__meta"> <strong>02</strong>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="connections-feature__panel " data-index="2">
