   <section class="connections-story">
    <div class="connections-story__inner">
     <article class="connections-story__block connections-story__block--text-image">
      <div class="connections-story__text">
       <h2>Inspiring Change</h2>
       <p>By supporting initiatives that promote respect, inclusion, and empathy, we hope to inspire positive values and encourage meaningful conversations that strengthen our communities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="connections-story__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260717133758_6a59bfb61368e5.38576102.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
     </article>
     <article class="connections-story__block connections-story__block--image-text">
      <div class="connections-story__text">
       <h2>Spark<br>
         Curiosity</h2>
       <p>By opening our doors to young explorers and local communities, we share the story behind every cup — from tea craftsmanship to the values that define KOI. Through hands-on experiences, we inspire curiosity and create meaningful connections with our brand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="connections-story__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260728142311_6a684acf0f6352.30588843.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
     </article>
     <article class="connections-story__block connections-story__block--image-top">
      <div class="connections-story__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260720135230_6a5db79ead0848.17296368.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
      <div class="connections-story__text">
       <h2>Share Kindness</h2>
       <p>By supporting meaningful community initiatives, we extend kindness beyond every cup and bring warmth and care to the communities we serve.</p>
      </div>
     </article>
    </div>
   </section>
